exports[`Markdown snapshots of the fixture: index.md 1`] = `
"# fixture 1.0

Every page: [llms.txt](llms.txt), or all in one file: [llms-full.txt](llms-full.txt)

API reference for fixture.

## Packages

- [\`fixture.java\`](fixture/java/index.md): Shapes, units and measurements: a fixture that exercises every declaration kind and documentation construct the API model represents.
- [\`fixture.java.io\`](fixture/java/io/index.md): Reading shapes from streams.

## Types in \`fixture.java\`

- [\`AbstractCanvas\`](fixture/java/AbstractCanvas.md) (abstract class): A canvas that counts what it draws.
- [\`Box\`](fixture/java/Box.md) (class): A mutable holder for one comparable value.
- [\`Canvas\`](fixture/java/Canvas.md) (interface): Somewhere to draw shapes.
- [\`Canvas.Layer\`](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.md) (interface): One layer of a canvas.
- [\`Canvas.Layer.Kind\`](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.Kind.md) (enum class): What a layer holds.
- [\`Circle\`](fixture/java/Circle.md) (record): A circle.
- [\`Geometry\`](fixture/java/Geometry.md) (class): Operations on shapes.
- [\`Geometry.Legacy\`](fixture/java/Geometry.Legacy.md) (class): Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.
- [\`GeometryException\`](fixture/java/GeometryException.md) (exception): A shape that cannot exist, such as a triangle whose sides violate the triangle inequality.
- [\`Measured\`](fixture/java/Measured.md) (annotation interface): Marks a declaration whose values are lengths, and in which unit.
- [\`Polygon\`](fixture/java/Polygon.md) (class): A regular polygon.
- [\`Polygon.Builder\`](fixture/java/Polygon.Builder.md) (class): Builds a polygon one side at a time.
- [\`Polygon.Edge\`](fixture/java/Polygon.Edge.md) (class): One edge of this polygon: an inner class, bound to its polygon.
- [\`Rect\`](fixture/java/Rect.md) (class): An axis-aligned rectangle.
- [\`Shape\`](fixture/java/Shape.md) (sealed interface): A closed plane figure.
- [\`Shape.Visitor\`](fixture/java/Shape.Visitor.md) (interface): Operations over each kind of shape.
- [\`Units\`](fixture/java/Units.md) (enum class): Units of length.

## Types in \`fixture.java.io\`

- [\`ShapeReader\`](fixture/java/io/ShapeReader.md) (class): Reads shapes in their text form, one per line.
"
`;

exports[`Markdown snapshots of the fixture: llms.txt 1`] = `
"# fixture 1.0

> API reference for fixture.

Each page below is Markdown; the HTML page of the same name has the same content. llms-full.txt has every page in one file, and api.json is the apidocs/1 model.

## Overview

- [fixture](index.md): packages and types
- [llms-full.txt](llms-full.txt): every page in one file
- [api.json](api.json): the apidocs/1 model

## Pages

- [Package fixture.java](fixture/java/index.md): Shapes, units and measurements: a fixture that exercises every declaration kind and documentation construct the API model represents.
- [AbstractCanvas (abstract class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/AbstractCanvas.md): A canvas that counts what it draws.
- [Box (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Box.md): A mutable holder for one comparable value.
- [Canvas (interface in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Canvas.md): Somewhere to draw shapes.
- [Canvas.Layer (interface in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.md): One layer of a canvas.
- [Canvas.Layer.Kind (enum class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Canvas.Layer.Kind.md): What a layer holds.
- [Circle (record in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Circle.md): A circle.
- [Geometry (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Geometry.md): Operations on shapes.
- [Geometry.Legacy (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Geometry.Legacy.md): Methods from before null markings; their nullness is unspecified.
- [GeometryException (exception in fixture.java)](fixture/java/GeometryException.md): A shape that cannot exist, such as a triangle whose sides violate the triangle inequality.
- [Measured (annotation interface in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Measured.md): Marks a declaration whose values are lengths, and in which unit.
- [Polygon (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Polygon.md): A regular polygon.
- [Polygon.Builder (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Polygon.Builder.md): Builds a polygon one side at a time.
- [Polygon.Edge (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Polygon.Edge.md): One edge of this polygon: an inner class, bound to its polygon.
- [Rect (class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Rect.md): An axis-aligned rectangle.
- [Shape (sealed interface in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Shape.md): A closed plane figure.
- [Shape.Visitor (interface in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Shape.Visitor.md): Operations over each kind of shape.
- [Units (enum class in fixture.java)](fixture/java/Units.md): Units of length.
- [Package fixture.java.io](fixture/java/io/index.md): Reading shapes from streams.
- [ShapeReader (class in fixture.java.io)](fixture/java/io/ShapeReader.md): Reads shapes in their text form, one per line.

## Indexes

- [Packages](packages.md): every package with its summary and type counts
- [All types](types.md): every type, nested ones too, by name
- [Index](index-all.md): every declaration from A to Z
- [Deprecated](deprecated.md): everything deprecated, for removal first
"
`;
